WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.271
Week 3: Objects, Gender, and the Classroom. identify people and objects ask what something is follow basic instructions

2
00:00:08.271 --> 00:00:14.601
Mission brief. Inventory a study space and give a partner five classroom instructions.

3
00:00:14.601 --> 00:00:24.006
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:24.006 --> 00:00:31.787
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:31.787 --> 00:00:40.314
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:40.314 --> 00:01:02.839
Model language. Hay un libro sobre la mesa. — There is a book on the table. ¿Qué es esto? — What is this? Es una pregunta importante. — It is an important question. Abran los cuadernos, por favor. — Open your notebooks, please. Las respuestas están en la página diez. — The answers are on page ten.

7
00:01:02.839 --> 00:01:12.737
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
